服装设计参考，在图1的纯白画布上生成一张专业游戏角色四视图设定图。\n\n严格使用横向四栏布局，画面中只出现同一个角色的四个视图，从左到右依次为：\n\n第一栏：人物半身正面照，从头部到腰部，正对镜头，清晰展示脸部、发型、上半身服装和配饰；\n第二栏：人物全身正视图，完整展示头部、身体、手部、腿部和鞋子；\n第三栏：人物全身标准右侧视图，身体严格旋转90度，完整展示侧面轮廓；\n第四栏：人物全身背视图，身体严格旋转180度，完整展示发型背面、服装背面和背部配饰。\n\n四个视图必须是同一个角色，保持完全相同的脸部、年龄、发型、体型、服装、材质、颜色、鞋子、配饰和武器。后三个全身视图必须等高、等比例、相同机位，统一自然A-pose，双手自然放置，双脚完整可见，人物之间留有均匀间距。\n\n第一栏的半身正面照允许适当放大，但不得遮挡其他视图。严格保持从左到右的指定顺序。\n\n背景必须是无纹理的纯白色 RGB(255,255,255)，无地面、无阴影、无渐变、无边框、无分隔线、无文字、无标题、无标签、无尺寸线、无水印、无额外人物、无额外视图。高质量游戏角色设定图，结构清晰，细节准确。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 14, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 16, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 9, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 12, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus", "title": "3. 正面提示词｜三视图角色设定图", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [590, 360], "pos": [-650, 300], "id": 13, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.5.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [8], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [330, 150], "pos": [-1620, 390], "widgets_values": [1920, 1080, 1, 16777215], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "批次大小"}, {"widget": {"name": "color"}, "name": "color", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "颜色"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "EmptyImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.16.4", "widget_ue_connectable": {"batch_size": true, "color": true, "width": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyImage"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## 使用方法\n\n1. 在“上传角色参考图”中选择一张清晰的全身角色图。\n2. 默认直接运行即可生成：**正面 / 侧面 / 背面**，从左到右横向排列。\n3. 白色画布默认为 1536 × 1024；显存不足可改为 1216 × 832。\n4. 提示词中的“图1”是白色画布，“图2”是角色参考图，请勿互换。\n5. 若三视图一致性不足，固定种子后微调提示词，或换用遮挡更少的全身参考图。\n\n> 纯白背景由白色底图与提示词共同约束。生成模型仍可能产生极浅阴影，正式建模前建议检查背景像素和服装背面结构。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用方法", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [313.8944091796875, 296.3848876953125], "pos": [-1620, 680], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "dir": 4, "type": "STRING"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "images", "links": [], "dir": 4, "type": "IMAGE"}], "size": [1334.7230224609375, 796.8115844726562], "pos": [1028.5606689453125, 586.8175048828125], "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_mynbi_00005_jufup_1784122597.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.9195592281583517&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI4NGQxODFmOTQ0ZmM2N2YwY2UxYjJmMDkwYWQ1YTAzNyIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODQ3MjczMjAyMjcsInRzIjoxNzg0MTIyNTIwMjI3LCJzaWduIjoiNWM1MjBkM2Q0NWIwNWIwNDEyY2VlY2NlNjM5ZmFmNTAifQ==&Rh-Identify=84d181f944fc67f0ce1b2f090ad5a037"}, {"name": "B", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_mynbi_00006_xkojo_1784122598.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.6201710778354282&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI4NGQxODFmOTQ0ZmM2N2YwY2UxYjJmMDkwYWQ1YTAzNyIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3ODQ3MjczMjAyMjcsInRzIjoxNzg0MTIyNTIwMjI3LCJzaWduIjoiNWM1MjBkM2Q0NWIwNWIwNDEyY2Vl